      "keywords": "be committed to collocation",
      "answer_explain": "be committed to doing 表示致力于做某事，其中 to 是介词，所以后接 providing。reminded 和 required 常用 be reminded/required to do，后面应接动词原形而非 providing；accepted 不构成这里所需的搭配。",
